Use the attached reference image as visual inspiration for the landing-page composition and background treatment.

IMPORTANT:
Do not copy the reference website, text, branding, layout exactly, or any recognizable design elements. Use it only as inspiration for the overall visual direction, composition, soft background shapes, product presentation and premium SaaS aesthetic.

Modify the existing FlowAI landing page rather than rebuilding the product from scratch.

# CORE BRIEF

FlowAI is a fictional AI-powered workspace that helps growing teams organize work and automate repetitive tasks.

Target audience:
- Growing businesses
- Modern teams
- Product teams
- Marketing teams
- Operations teams

Primary objective:
Encourage visitors to **Book a Demo**.

The hero should immediately communicate:
1. What FlowAI is
2. How AI helps
3. Who it is for
4. Why it is useful
5. The primary action: Book a Demo

# OVERALL VISUAL DIRECTION

Create a premium, modern, light SaaS landing page inspired by the visual atmosphere of the attached reference.

The overall feeling should be:

Premium
Clean
Soft
Intelligent
Modern
Human
Trustworthy
Business-focused

Do NOT make it look like a generic dark AI startup.

Use a predominantly light visual system.

# COLOR PALETTE

Primary background:
#F8F9FC

White:
#FFFFFF

Primary text:
#111827

Secondary text:
#667085

Primary brand:
#5B5CEB

Secondary accent:
#6C63FF

Soft lavender:
#EEF0FF

Soft blue:
#EAF2FF

Success accent:
#22B8A7

Borders:
#E5E7EB

Use blue, indigo and lavender as subtle accents rather than strong neon gradients.

Avoid excessive purple.

# HERO BACKGROUND

Create a visually interesting hero background inspired by the attached reference.

Add several large, extremely soft abstract circular/organic shapes behind the hero content.

Use very subtle:
- Pale blue
- Soft lavender
- Very light indigo

The shapes should appear like blurred atmospheric blobs or large soft circles.

They should sit BEHIND the content and product interface.

Example visual treatment:

Large soft blue circular shape behind the right side of the product.

Large pale lavender shape partially visible behind the hero.

Another subtle blue shape near the bottom-right.

Use very low opacity and strong blur.

These shapes should create depth without distracting from the content.

DO NOT use sharp geometric shapes.

DO NOT use bright neon glow.

The background should feel elegant and almost editorial.

# HERO COMPOSITION

Use a two-column desktop hero.

LEFT:
Marketing content.

RIGHT:
Large horizontal FlowAI product experience / video.

The right-side visual should be the main visual focal point.

Desktop layout approximately:

Left column: 42%

Right column: 58%

Maintain generous whitespace.

# NAVIGATION

Create a clean white/light navigation bar.

Left:
FlowAI logo

Center:
Product
Solutions
Resources
Pricing

Right:
Sign In
Book a Demo

Book a Demo should be the primary indigo CTA.

Use subtle shadow or border.

Keep the navigation minimal.

# HERO LABEL

Add a small pill above the headline:

AI-powered workspace for modern teams

Use:
- Soft lavender background
- Indigo text
- Small AI/lightning icon

Keep it subtle.

# HERO HEADLINE

Use:

Work smarter.
Let AI handle the busywork.

Make the headline large, bold and highly readable.

Use dark navy for the majority of the text.

Use the brand indigo only to emphasize:

“Let AI”

Do NOT use a strong multi-color gradient across the entire headline.

Desktop headline approximately:
64–72px

Line height:
1.05–1.1

# HERO DESCRIPTION

Use:

“FlowAI brings your team's projects, tasks and workflows into one intelligent workspace — while AI automates the repetitive work.”

Make the paragraph readable and comfortable.

Maximum width approximately:
520px.

# CTA

Primary:
Book a Demo →

Secondary:
▶ See How It Works

Primary CTA:
Indigo background
White text
Rounded corners
Subtle shadow

Secondary CTA:
White background
Dark text
Thin border

Add below:

“No credit card required · 30-minute personalized demo”

# RIGHT-SIDE PRODUCT VIDEO

Replace the current static dashboard hero visual with a large horizontal product-demo video area.

The video container should be approximately:

680px × 380px

Aspect ratio:
16:9

Use a large rounded rectangle.

Border radius:
20–28px

Use a soft shadow.

The product video should show FlowAI actually working.

The video should demonstrate:

Customer request
↓
AI understands request
↓
Task created
↓
Team member assigned
↓
Workflow completed

The interface should look like a real productivity SaaS product.

Use:
- White dashboard
- Light gray surfaces
- Dark navy text
- Indigo active states
- Teal success states

Add subtle product UI animation.

# VIDEO PRESENTATION

Do not make the video look like a YouTube embed.

It should feel like an integrated product experience.

Create a clean video frame with:

FlowAI Workspace

Projects
Tasks
Automations
AI Assistant
Team

Within the interface show an automation happening.

Example:

“New customer request”

AI analyzes request

↓

“Customer onboarding flow”

↓

“Assigned to Sarah”

↓

“AI Automation completed”

The final success state should show:

✓ Automation completed

Customer request → Task created → Team assigned

Keep the video clean and readable.

# BACKGROUND AROUND VIDEO

Use the soft blue/lavender abstract shapes behind the video.

One large pale blue circular blob should sit partially behind the upper-right portion of the video.

Another soft lavender blob should sit behind the lower-right area.

Use very low opacity and strong blur.

The shapes should extend slightly beyond the video container.

This creates the layered visual effect shown in the reference.

# PRODUCT DEPTH

The product/video container should have:

- Soft shadow
- Very subtle border
- Rounded corners
- Slight depth
- Clean white UI

Do not use heavy glassmorphism.

Do not use excessive glow.

# SOCIAL PROOF

Below the hero content, add a subtle trust indicator.

Example:

★★★★★

10,000+ teams love FlowAI

Use small circular avatar images or abstract profile placeholders.

Keep this section understated.

# HERO HEIGHT

The hero should feel spacious.

Use approximately:
720–800px desktop hero height.

Do not make it excessively tall.

The user should be able to see the beginning of the next section at the bottom of the viewport.

# NEXT SECTION PREVIEW

At the bottom of the hero, introduce the next section with:

TRUSTED BY TEAMS BUILDING WHAT'S NEXT

Use a subtle light-gray background transition.

This should visually continue from the hero.

# RESPONSIVE MOBILE

Create a proper 390px mobile version.

Do not simply scale the desktop design.

Mobile order:

Navigation
↓
AI-powered workspace label
↓
Headline
↓
Description
↓
Book a Demo
↓
See How It Works
↓
Product video
↓
Social proof

The abstract background shapes should remain but become much more subtle.

The video should remain horizontal and fit naturally within the mobile viewport.

Use:
- 20–24px border radius
- Full-width video
- No horizontal scrolling
- Comfortable CTA sizes
- 42–48px hero heading

# DESIGN SYSTEM

Use:
Inter or Geist

Spacing:
8px spacing system

Border radius:
12–28px

Buttons:
44–52px height

Cards:
16–24px radius

Use consistent shadows and borders.

# IMPORTANT UX PRINCIPLE

The landing page should tell a clear story:

PROBLEM
Teams spend too much time managing work.

↓

SOLUTION
FlowAI brings work into one intelligent workspace.

↓

AI DIFFERENTIATOR
AI automates repetitive tasks.

↓

PROOF
Show the product actually performing the automation.

↓

ACTION
Book a Demo.

Do not add unnecessary sections or decorative elements that do not support this story.

# FINAL RESULT

The final FlowAI landing page should feel like a premium real-world SaaS product website.

It should combine:
- The soft blue/lavender atmospheric background from the reference
- A clean light interface
- Strong typography
- A horizontal product video on the right
- Realistic product UI
- Subtle depth
- Strong conversion hierarchy
- Professional B2B SaaS credibility

The reference image should influence the visual mood and composition only.

Do not reproduce its exact website, navigation, copy, colors, branding or layout.